⇒ {2Cos²{θ over 2}} times (1 + tan {θ over 2}) over {2Cos²{θ over 2}} times (1 - tan {θ over 2})

⇒ ({1 + tan frac{θ )/(2)}}{{1 - tan (θ )/(2)}}

∴ The required answer is ({1 + tan frac{θ )/(2)}}{{1 - tan (θ )/(2)}}

